Monday
Today we cleaned our apartment, and had some awful stressful drama with a
member, but its over so no worries =F0=9F=98=81=E2=9C=A8=EF=B8=8F

Tuesday-Thursday
Outside of the usual, we had an apartment inspection (A++++), met to draw
with Kanda san, went to the dentist, and had Kids Eikaiwa! For some reason
one of the kids parents gave us 5 American dollars she found in her house,
and we split them up between the kids lol

Friday
Today we cooked up some fancy steak that Kanda san gave us, and also met
and invited Kitagawa san to Baptism! She was shocked lol, she's the owner
of a shrine, but she's seriously considering our invitation. She was asking
a lot of good questions, and she even called us on this next Monday to ask
when we can meet to talk more about it. She's so cool. Tonight was Game
night, and Hinata kun brought one of his friends!! Having young people at
the church is a blessing, even if they are like in their early teens lol.

Saturday
Today we had a lot of time for housing, and met a girl in her 20s who wants
to meet up with us again! We prayed about where we should go finding, and
she was at the first house we Knocked on. She loves art, and is like a
Professional at manga! so Cool, her name is Akari san. Today we also had a
good lesson with Matsuoka san. Good day.

Sunday
Today we visited so many people! We caroled and blessed the Sacrament for
Sister Junko, Brother Katayama, and Sang for Sister Maggi and her Filipino
Roomates! We felt the spirit so strongly =F0=9F=98=8A We were also able to =
visit the
Yamauchi Family and the guy named Shinichi san (who likes radio) with
Brother Hisamune. It was so fun, and a huge Blessing.

Jesus Christ loves you. So do I! Pray in your afflictions. It will all be
OK. Catch you next week =F0=9F=98=8A=E2=9C=A8=EF=B8=8F

